<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπασχολ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leave</i> one <i>no leisure, keep</i> him
				<i>employed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philops.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				2.21
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be wholly occupied</i> or <i>engrossed,</i> so
			as to attend to nothing else, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Charid.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				108.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				107.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπὶ τῆς ἀλλοδαπῆς</span>
			<i>to be absent</i> on foreign service, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				71 ii 8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς συνεχείας τῶν φυτῶν ἀπασχολούσης ἐς
				ἑαυτὴν τὰ βέλη</span>
			<i>rendering</i> them <i>of none effect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				7.2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὰ τῶν ἡδίστων</span>
			<i>detain</i> him <i>from . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
